@startuml
title Cumulative Corpus Update - Boundary / Input / Processing / Output

left to right direction

rectangle "1. Corpus Update\n\nInput\n- Current Corpus v2\n- Incoming snapshot refs\n\nProcess\n- existing + incoming\n- snapshot-ref first-win unique\n- v1 head rejected\n\nOutput\n- CorpusVersion v2" as Corpus

rectangle "2. Cumulative Projection\n\nInput\n- Ordered snapshot refs\n\nProcess\n- corpus order\n- source_index ASC\n- 5-field exact dedupe\n- first-wins\n- no normalization\n\nOutput\n- Survivor observations" as Projection

rectangle "3. Classification\n\nInput\n- Survivors\n- Prior ClassificationVersion\n\nProcess\n1 prior identity label\n2 same-comment label\n3 human decision\n- resolved items MUST NOT reach ChatGPT\n\nOutput\n- Complete ClassificationVersion" as Classification

rectangle "4. Analysis Source\n\nInput\n- CorpusVersion\n- ClassificationVersion\n\nProcess\n- exact coverage assertion\n- public source_index re-numbering\n\nOutput\n- Source Dataset v2" as Source

rectangle "5. Analysis / Release / Deploy\n\nInput\n- Source Dataset v2\n\nProcess\n- keyword\n- account\n- overview\n- comments\n- cross-pin + SHA gates\n- actual deploy\n- recovery verify against served artifacts\n\nOutput\n- Verified production Release\n- immutable recovery verification evidence" as Release

Corpus --> Projection
Projection --> Classification
Classification --> Source
Source --> Release

note bottom of Projection
Logical population =
Existing valid data
+ Newly added data
- exact 5-field duplicates
end note

note bottom of Classification
ChatGPT handoff invariant:
priorIdentityLabel == none
AND
priorCommentLabel == none
end note

rectangle "R. One-time Recovery\n\nInput\n- baseCorpusVersionId\n- brokenHeadCorpusVersionId\n\nProcess\n- recovery_frozen + drain\n- stable recovery plan\n- rebuild Corpus v2\n- recover exact-dedupe-group labels\n- classify genuinely unresolved only\n\nOutput\n- Corrected cumulative state" as Recovery

Recovery ..> Corpus : bootstrap before normal updates

note bottom of Release
Issue close gate:
production recovery executed
AND corrected release deployed
AND recovery verify passed
AND previouslyResolvedItemCount = 0
end note

@enduml
